OL,3,GNEWSAThe school hit by a wartime bomber
OL,4,Athat was on its way home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident killed all four crew
OL,7,Fmembers along with 49-year-old French
OL,8,Fteacher Edith Fowle, who was on the
OL,9,Fsecond floor of the building when the
OL,10,Faircraft struck.
